"entity": {
"name": "Driven Brands Holdings, Inc.",
"description": "Driven Brands Holdings, Inc. engages in the provision of automotive services. It operates through the following segments: Take 5, Franchise Brands, and Auto Glass Now. The Take 5 segment consists of the Take 5 Oil which services a combination of retail and commercial customers through 1,342 locations. The Franchise Brands segment consists of a portfolio of brands including Meineke, Maaco, CARSTAR, ABRA, Fix Auto, 1-800 Radiator, Uniban, and Automotive Training Institute (ATI) and serves retail, commercial, and insurance customers. The Auto Glass Now segment offers auto glass replacement, repair, and calibration services and serves retail, commercial, and insurance customers. The company was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Charlotte, NC.",
